WEBVTT

00:00:08.542 --> 00:00:10.292
Class...

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.958
There's something I forgot
to mention in my earlier lesson:

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:20.417
Even an assassin who's
cleverly avoided all head-to-head battles

00:00:20.417 --> 00:00:23.208
is sure to have a number of times in life

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:27.500
when he or she must fight
with every last ounce of strength.

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:31.417
In my case...

00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:33.583
...that would be now!

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:47.208
Koro Sensei!

00:00:59.417 --> 00:01:01.833
<i>"Wait, just hang on a sec!"</i>

00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:04.833
<i>I scream, but it gets me nowhere</i>

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:07.292
<i>I put all my strength into being afraid of</i>

00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:10.125
<i>The limits that just kept on closing in</i>

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:12.667
<i>Reality is merciless</i>

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:15.375
<i>And time is especially tricky</i>

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:20.625
<i>It's like someone's snatching away</i>
<i>the blanket I just can't sleep without</i>

00:01:20.625 --> 00:01:26.708
<i>We laughed and fretted</i>

00:01:26.708 --> 00:01:31.250
<i>Over silly things, nonsensical things</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:37.375
<i>Once the final bell rings out</i>

00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:41.958
<i>The fun times will be over, too</i>

00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:43.500
<i>Bye-bye, yesterday</i>

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:49.500
<i>365 days' worth of lessons shoved into bags</i>

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.625
<i>Like always, like it's "see you tomorrow"</i>

00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:54.167
<i>Bye-bye, yesterday</i>

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:58.250
<i>365 days' worth of happenings</i>

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:03.250
<i>If you've made me an adult,</i>
<i>don't be showing me tears</i>

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:04.750
<i>Bye-bye, yesterday</i>

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:23.958
<i>365 days' worth of memories</i>

00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:27.958
"23rd Period: Final Boss Time"
"by Ryunosuke Chiba & Rinka Hayami"

00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:39.208
A sonic boom with every attack...

00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:43.833
That's the kind of nonstandard
battle that was underway.

00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:48.250
Though we can't make out
their movements, we know this much:

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:52.125
Koro Sensei is overwhelmingly losing ground!

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:58.833
Koro Sensei!

00:03:05.042 --> 00:03:07.875
Feeling hopeless yet, guinea pig?

00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:11.125
Two people, times tentacles...

00:03:11.125 --> 00:03:14.375
...times genius... times the power of hate.

00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:19.250
He's <i>far </i>surpassed the likes of you!

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:32.667
Please--

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:36.000
teach me to kill!

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:41.500
Are you sure? That was
your father I just killed, you know.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:43.417
That doesn't matter!

00:03:43.417 --> 00:03:47.208
When I saw you,
my father's killer, it came to me:

00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:50.833
<i>This </i>is what my life
of luxury has been missing!

00:03:50.833 --> 00:03:57.083
I want to have your skills!
Even if I die trying!

00:03:58.583 --> 00:04:01.583
The boy didn't know right from wrong,

00:04:01.583 --> 00:04:03.875
but his eyes were brimming with talent

00:04:03.875 --> 00:04:07.375
and his own brand of hopes and dreams.

00:04:08.375 --> 00:04:10.042
It's at this point,

00:04:10.042 --> 00:04:12.208
before he threw away
his tomorrows and his sanity

00:04:12.208 --> 00:04:15.083
that there must have been
another way to raise him.

00:04:27.583 --> 00:04:29.667
They're not even in the same dimension.

00:04:32.375 --> 00:04:35.583
This battle is too mismatched...

00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:38.708
Enough to make you think
all our hard work over the past year

00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:41.792
was meaningless.

00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:45.917
We were a hindrance.

00:04:45.917 --> 00:04:49.625
We couldn't do anything--not even run away.

00:04:49.625 --> 00:04:53.792
We were Koro Sensei's greatest--

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.250
Is he... starting to dodge?!

00:05:09.333 --> 00:05:12.333
Hmph. Then how about <i>this</i>?

00:05:12.333 --> 00:05:13.958
What the--?!

00:05:22.792 --> 00:05:24.583
Wow...

00:05:24.583 --> 00:05:27.542
Evading attacks with
the minimum amount of strength,

00:05:27.542 --> 00:05:30.083
using soil to block the light...

00:05:30.083 --> 00:05:33.375
He's closing in and "killing" their power.

00:05:33.375 --> 00:05:36.792
Seeing him improvise a way
to close their battle-power gap...

00:05:36.792 --> 00:05:40.167
That's our Koro Sensei--through and through.

00:05:40.167 --> 00:05:43.542
Chalk <i>this </i>part up to sheer experience!

00:05:49.458 --> 00:05:52.083
This is where I,
his teacher, take responsibility

00:05:52.083 --> 00:05:55.583
for my pupil who's strayed from the path.

00:05:55.583 --> 00:05:57.167
However...

00:05:57.167 --> 00:06:00.208
Yanagisawa. Leave us.

00:06:01.208 --> 00:06:04.208
This is a place for students to learn and grow.

00:06:04.208 --> 00:06:07.042
You are not entitled to be here!

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:12.917
Still fancy yourself a teacher, eh, guinea pig?

00:06:12.917 --> 00:06:16.125
Then let's put you to the test.

00:06:16.125 --> 00:06:22.542
Don't you see why we chose
this moment to make our move?

00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:27.917
You'll protect them, right?

00:06:27.917 --> 00:06:30.958
Isn't that what a teacher does?

00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:40.917
What's this?!

00:06:40.917 --> 00:06:42.708
Where are the kids?

00:06:50.083 --> 00:06:51.625
Koro Sensei!

00:06:56.792 --> 00:07:00.167
Koro Sensei!

00:07:00.167 --> 00:07:03.500
You're the very model
of an educator, guinea pig!

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:07.042
You can escape these
harsh blows on your own,

00:07:07.042 --> 00:07:11.333
yet you take them head-on
to protect your students!

00:07:11.333 --> 00:07:14.667
All right, 2.0: next!

00:07:20.875 --> 00:07:22.458
Next.

00:07:23.333 --> 00:07:25.125
Next!

00:07:25.125 --> 00:07:28.958
Next! Next! Next!

00:07:31.333 --> 00:07:35.667
Such darkly seething emotions...

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:40.958
The strongest feeling in the world
is the bloodlust born of love.

00:07:40.958 --> 00:07:45.833
He surely won't be satisfied
until the target is torn to pieces,

00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:47.875
body and soul...

00:07:52.917 --> 00:07:54.708
Koro Sensei!

00:07:54.708 --> 00:08:00.167
Put the target with his students
and this was bound to happen.

00:08:00.167 --> 00:08:03.083
Wrong answer, kids.

00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:07.625
Deciding to show up here
tonight was a bad move.

00:08:09.542 --> 00:08:11.833
Stop, Yanagisawa!

00:08:11.833 --> 00:08:14.833
Don't drag those students in any deeper!

00:08:18.375 --> 00:08:19.750
Karasuma!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:23.083
Shut up and watch, government lapdogs.

00:08:23.083 --> 00:08:27.083
You don't stand a chance against me now.

00:08:30.167 --> 00:08:34.542
We'd seen it all along.

00:08:34.542 --> 00:08:36.917
We'd seen it, and yet...

00:08:36.917 --> 00:08:39.292
...we'd looked away.

00:08:39.292 --> 00:08:42.458
I estimate seven or eight of them will die.

00:08:42.458 --> 00:08:46.708
You'll have to jump in
and save them, Koro Sensei.

00:08:47.875 --> 00:08:50.083
How does it feel?

00:08:50.083 --> 00:08:53.125
What's it like, seeing your despairing students

00:08:53.125 --> 00:08:56.875
being a hindrance to their dear, dear teacher?

00:08:58.708 --> 00:09:04.667
<i>Now </i>do you see it? Your greatest weak point?

00:09:04.667 --> 00:09:09.958
Koro Sensei's greatest weak point--it was...

00:09:09.958 --> 00:09:10.708
"Us"

00:09:10.708 --> 00:09:14.083
--...us.
--That's preposterous!

00:09:17.083 --> 00:09:20.250
This isn't a question of right answer or wrong!

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:23.583
They risked life and limb to try to save me,

00:09:23.583 --> 00:09:27.208
and overcame obstacles to meet me here!

00:09:27.208 --> 00:09:30.625
That process, those hearts--

00:09:30.625 --> 00:09:34.417
they're the greatest gift
a teacher could receive!

00:09:34.417 --> 00:09:37.500
They're <i>not </i>a weak point,
and they're <i>not </i>a hindrance!

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.042
They're my <i>students</i>!

00:09:39.042 --> 00:09:44.125
And I'm proud of each and every one of them!

00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:45.500
What's more...

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:51.167
...protecting one's students
is a teacher's natural duty!

00:09:53.417 --> 00:10:00.167
Yes, yes, very good. But we'll
deny you that duty of yours, too.

00:10:00.167 --> 00:10:02.750
Soon your strength will run out,

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.458
and the students you've been protecting?

00:10:05.458 --> 00:10:09.333
I will <i>slaughter </i>them.

00:10:10.042 --> 00:10:14.667
This year you gained by destroying our lives...

00:10:14.667 --> 00:10:17.667
I'll make it have been all for naught!

00:10:17.667 --> 00:10:22.583
Then our revenge will finally be complete!

00:10:22.583 --> 00:10:24.333
Now, let's continue.

00:10:24.333 --> 00:10:27.875
Better protect those sweet students of yours.

00:10:29.125 --> 00:10:30.167
Huh?!

00:10:30.167 --> 00:10:31.375
You fool!

00:10:31.375 --> 00:10:32.833
But--how?!

00:10:34.833 --> 00:10:37.000
Run, Koro Sensei.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.417
I'll buy you time--
just hide somewhere and recover!

00:10:40.417 --> 00:10:42.125
Kayano?!

00:10:49.125 --> 00:10:50.708
Oho...

00:10:50.708 --> 00:10:53.250
That's a former tentacle-user for you.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.083
Retained that kinetic vision, I see.

00:10:56.083 --> 00:10:58.958
Stop, Kayano!

00:10:58.958 --> 00:11:01.875
I'd regretted it all this time.

00:11:01.875 --> 00:11:07.125
That it was my fault
the class learned the truth.

00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:11.667
That I snatched away
the fun times we'd had together.

00:11:11.667 --> 00:11:15.458
So at least... let me protect you...

00:11:15.458 --> 00:11:17.458
...as your student!

00:11:17.458 --> 00:11:19.250
You were right!

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:20.708
Thanks to your actions,

00:11:20.708 --> 00:11:24.250
the class got to learn
what was truly important!

00:11:27.458 --> 00:11:29.583
2.0?

00:11:39.375 --> 00:11:42.708
Don't worry, Koro Sensei.

00:11:42.708 --> 00:11:44.292
You can do it if you try.

00:11:44.292 --> 00:11:49.000
You know who taught me that? My sister...

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.875
...and you!

00:12:28.292 --> 00:12:32.458
I get to have <i>both </i>sisters
die right in front of me?!

00:12:33.583 --> 00:12:37.167
What a couple of troublemakers!

00:12:37.167 --> 00:12:42.042
Maybe I should've kept her
as her sister's stand-in!

00:12:42.042 --> 00:12:47.875
Too bad I'm not interested in some holey bitch.

00:12:59.958 --> 00:13:03.958
"Assassination Classroom, Final Season"
"by Kaede Kayano"

00:13:08.875 --> 00:13:10.542
<i>There </i>we go!

00:13:10.542 --> 00:13:12.750
When you're beside yourself,
your emotions twisted,

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:16.000
your whole body goes pitch-black!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:19.542
You couldn't be at full power otherwise.

00:13:19.542 --> 00:13:22.292
In other words, <i>this </i>is the destructive creature

00:13:22.292 --> 00:13:24.417
showing his true colors!

00:13:24.417 --> 00:13:27.917
You yourself have
negated the whole year you spent

00:13:27.917 --> 00:13:31.292
wearing that ridiculous yellow hypocrite's face!

00:13:31.292 --> 00:13:34.500
<i>Most </i>satisfactory!

00:13:36.083 --> 00:13:40.708
And as for this full-bore fury of yours...

00:13:42.708 --> 00:13:47.917
In showing his true power,
2.0 will negate that, too.

00:13:47.917 --> 00:13:51.083
Now for his final attack.

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:07.000
Let's get away from here!

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:08.542
Nagisa?

00:14:08.542 --> 00:14:11.083
Now, while his attention is elsewhere!

00:14:11.083 --> 00:14:13.917
If we stay, we'll get
tangled up in this for sure!

00:14:13.917 --> 00:14:15.292
B-But...

00:14:15.292 --> 00:14:19.542
Running away is
a perfectly sound battle tactic!

00:14:34.792 --> 00:14:38.333
This was one hellish year, all right.

00:14:38.333 --> 00:14:41.583
But it ends now.

00:14:57.958 --> 00:15:01.042
What?! A white light?

00:15:01.042 --> 00:15:05.125
No--his tentacles are still black.

00:15:05.125 --> 00:15:08.125
No... it's yellow.

00:15:08.125 --> 00:15:10.458
Nuh-uh--red!

00:15:10.458 --> 00:15:12.167
Green!

00:15:12.167 --> 00:15:14.500
Blue!

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:16.250
White!

00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:24.083
All my colors...
all my emotions... all my past...

00:15:24.083 --> 00:15:28.708
All my life, all mixed together...

00:15:28.708 --> 00:15:31.917
...into pure-white energy.

00:15:31.917 --> 00:15:34.167
My pupil...

00:15:34.167 --> 00:15:38.958
May your graduation, at least, be peaceful.

00:15:45.083 --> 00:15:51.167
Sh-Shit! If that thing
only liquefies tentacles...

00:15:51.167 --> 00:15:55.292
Nooo!

00:16:04.125 --> 00:16:06.125
What's with the flowers?

00:16:06.125 --> 00:16:08.833
I just picked a few for decoration.

00:16:08.833 --> 00:16:14.083
Thought a soothing skill like that could,
you know, come in handy.

00:16:14.083 --> 00:16:16.958
I can get rid of them if they're in the way.

00:16:23.625 --> 00:16:28.250
No, leave them. You've got a good eye.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.417
Better than mine.

00:16:29.417 --> 00:16:34.125
Oh, good! Then I'll bring in
new ones every day!

00:16:34.125 --> 00:16:36.083
You <i>could</i>...

00:16:36.083 --> 00:16:38.833
...but you ought to be
studying chemistry daily instead.

00:16:38.833 --> 00:16:42.667
You couldn't kill a mosquito
with what you know now.

00:16:46.917 --> 00:16:49.125
If only I had seen that smile,

00:16:49.125 --> 00:16:53.833
I might have been able to
guide him to an entirely different life.

00:17:08.875 --> 00:17:15.750
The tentacles asked me what I wanted to be.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:20.250
I wanted you to acknowledge me.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:25.333
I wanted... to be like you.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:30.250
Now I can understand how you feel.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:35.208
If we meet on the other side...
let's study together.

00:17:35.208 --> 00:17:39.417
So we won't make the same mistakes.

00:17:52.917 --> 00:17:57.292
No one shouted for joy.

00:18:12.208 --> 00:18:14.125
Koro Sensei?

00:18:14.125 --> 00:18:15.708
Kayano--she's...

00:18:18.667 --> 00:18:20.542
Kaede...

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.542
Let's lay her down.

00:18:24.542 --> 00:18:27.583
No, don't, Nagisa.

00:18:27.583 --> 00:18:32.417
I don't want her to have too much
contact with germs in the soil.

00:18:32.417 --> 00:18:34.292
Koro Sensei...

00:18:34.292 --> 00:18:39.583
Class, the past you've lost
will never come back.

00:18:39.583 --> 00:18:44.250
I myself have made so many mistakes...

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.875
But we can learn from the past

00:18:46.875 --> 00:18:49.958
so we don't repeat it.

00:18:51.375 --> 00:18:53.500
Huh? Wh-What's this?

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:57.375
Kayano's blood and somatic cells.

00:18:57.375 --> 00:18:59.667
I gathered them up
before she fell to the ground

00:18:59.667 --> 00:19:01.708
and stored them in a sterile membrane I made

00:19:01.708 --> 00:19:03.750
with compressed air.

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:06.625
I-In the middle of battle?!

00:19:06.625 --> 00:19:09.375
I'd set aside the tentacles
meant for protecting you.

00:19:09.375 --> 00:19:13.208
Those were the only ones
I didn't use for fighting.

00:19:14.292 --> 00:19:19.542
Now to string all these
cells together, one by one.

00:19:19.542 --> 00:19:21.792
Faster,

00:19:21.792 --> 00:19:24.167
more accurately...

00:19:24.167 --> 00:19:28.667
I've been improving my skills all year long--

00:19:28.667 --> 00:19:35.042
so if the same thing happens again,
it won't have the same tragic ending.

00:19:35.042 --> 00:19:39.542
Some cells can't be repaired,
so instead I'll leave gaps

00:19:39.542 --> 00:19:42.833
and fill them with my mucus.

00:19:42.833 --> 00:19:49.542
Within a few days, her own cells
should regenerate and replace it.

00:19:49.542 --> 00:19:54.250
I'm a tad low on blood.
Type AB donors, please!

00:19:56.083 --> 00:20:00.875
Nakamura! Gather up that
birthday cake and put it in my mouth!

00:20:00.875 --> 00:20:01.833
Whaaat?

00:20:01.833 --> 00:20:04.792
But it's a smashed-up pile
of dirt-covered garbage!

00:20:04.792 --> 00:20:07.458
I need to replenish my energy!

00:20:07.458 --> 00:20:10.917
<i>And </i>I wanted to eat it that whole fight!
I call the 30-minute rule!

00:20:10.917 --> 00:20:12.208
30-<i>second</i>!

00:20:12.208 --> 00:20:15.250
Delish, delish, delish...

00:20:17.083 --> 00:20:19.583
The wound's closing up--

00:20:19.583 --> 00:20:24.042
without a single stitch,
without leaving a single mark.

00:20:27.292 --> 00:20:29.542
Now, once her heart starts working, she'll come back to life.

00:20:29.542 --> 00:20:30.625
"What to Do for a Gut-Shot Student" "by Koro Sensei"
Now, once her heart starts working, she'll come back to life.

00:20:30.625 --> 00:20:32.792
"What to Do for a Gut-Shot Student" "by Koro Sensei"
It should go perfectly, according to my

00:20:32.792 --> 00:20:35.958
"What to Do for a Gut-Shot Student" "by Koro Sensei"
"What to Do for a Gut-Shot Student" manual.

00:20:35.958 --> 00:20:39.250
Who'd even anticipate such a disaster?!

00:20:40.667 --> 00:20:45.250
I can say this now, but if your bodies
were ever torn to pieces,

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:48.708
I was prepared to put them back together.

00:20:48.708 --> 00:20:52.833
As long as I'm around, that is.

00:20:54.292 --> 00:20:56.375
As long as the teacher...

00:20:56.375 --> 00:20:58.958
...is properly seeing his student.

00:21:15.667 --> 00:21:19.542
Did you save me... again?

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:23.417
As many times as it takes.

00:21:23.417 --> 00:21:26.792
Your sister would have done the same.

00:21:32.667 --> 00:21:37.875
The important thing is
not repeating your mistakes.

00:21:37.875 --> 00:21:42.917
Aguri? Did I do a good job as a teacher...

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:50.792
...during this treasure
of a year that you gave me?

00:21:56.500 --> 00:22:07.458
<i>The memories I've arranged</i>
<i>little by little keep me warm</i>

00:22:07.458 --> 00:22:19.000
<i>A small room, hearts connecting:</i>
<i>you taught me gently</i>

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:31.750
<i>Once this season comes for me, I won't be able</i>

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:37.000
<i>To search out your figure anymore</i>

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:42.750
<i>I'll never forget</i>

00:22:42.750 --> 00:23:02.059
<i>Until the day I can see you again</i>
